<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>诉讼实现公平正义 - 思维导图</title>
<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimHei", sans-serif;
    background: #f5f0e8;
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #222;
  }

  .page {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 30px 40px;
    min-height: 900px;
    position: relative;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(#e8e8e8 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, #e8e8e8 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
  }

  .title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a6b3c;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #1a6b3c;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .mindmap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .branch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .branch::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -15px;
    top: 12px;
    width: 15px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #333;
  }

  .branch-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #1a3a6b;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 120px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: #e8f0fe;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border-left: 4px solid #1a3a6b;
  }

  .branch-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 4px 8px;
  }

  .sub-branch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-left: 30px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sub-branch::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -20px;
    top: 10px;
    width: 20px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #666;
  }

  .sub-branch-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #4a2d6b;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    background: #f0e8fe;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border-left: 3px solid #4a2d6b;
  }

  .sub-branch-content {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
  }

  .detail {
    margin-left: 40px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #444;
    padding-left: 15px;
    border-left: 2px solid #aaa;
  }

  .detail-item {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .red-text {
    color: #cc0000;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .green-text {
    color: #1a6b3c;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .blue-text {
    color: #1a3a6b;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a6b3c;
    margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: #e8f5e9;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border-left: 5px solid #1a6b3c;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .main-branch {
    margin: 15px 0;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  }

  .main-branch-header {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a3a6b;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1a3a6b;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    color: #cc0000;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .footer-note {
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #888;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    background: #fffde7;
    border: 1px solid #f9a825;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 5px 0;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .tree-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tree-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .tree-connector {
    width: 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .tree-node {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .indent-1 { margin-left: 20px; }
  .indent-2 { margin-left: 50px; }
  .indent-3 { margin-left: 80px; }

  .node-box {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 2px 0;
  }

  .node-primary {
    background: #e3f2fd;
    border: 1px solid #1976d2;
    color: #1565c0;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .node-secondary {
    background: #f3e5f5;
    border: 1px solid #7b1fa2;
    color: #6a1b9a;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .node-tertiary {
    background: #e8f5e9;
    border: 1px solid #388e3c;
    color: #2e7d32;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .node-detail {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #555;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-left: 3px solid #bbb;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }

  .process-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 5px 0;
  }

  .process-step {
    background: #fff3e0;
    border: 1px solid #e65100;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .process-arrow {
    color: #e65100;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .comparison-table th,
  .comparison-table td {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .comparison-table th {
    background: #e8eaf6;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #283593;
  }

  .comparison-table td {
    background: #fafafa;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="title">诉讼实现公平正义</div>

  <div class="mindmap">

    <!-- 诉讼权利 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 诉讼权利</div>
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-tertiary">当事人有委托诉讼代理人的权利</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-tertiary">当事人有申请回避的权利</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">└</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-tertiary">当事人有上诉的权利</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 不同审级次数规定 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 不同审级次数规定</div>
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <tr>
          <th>诉讼类型</th>
          <th>上诉期限</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>行政诉讼</td>
          <td>上诉期限为15日、10日</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>民事诉讼</td>
          <td>上诉期限分别为10日、15日</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- 诉讼程序 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 诉讼程序</div>

      <!-- 起诉 -->
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-secondary">起诉</span>
          <div class="node-detail">
            <div class="detail-item">• 行政诉讼程序的第一步</div>
            <div class="detail-item">• 原告认为行政机关的行政行为不合法时，可以向有管辖权的人民法院提出</div>
            <div class="detail-item"><span class="flow-arrow">起诉 → 诉讼程序开始</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 应诉 -->
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-secondary">应诉</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 开庭审理 -->
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-secondary">开庭审理</span>
          <div class="node-detail">
            <div class="detail-item">• 行政诉讼程序中<strong>最重要环节</strong></div>
            <div class="detail-item">• 开庭审理围绕<strong>核心</strong></div>
            <div class="process-flow">
              <span class="process-step">开庭准备</span>
              <span class="process-arrow">→</span>
              <span class="process-step">法庭调查</span>
              <span class="process-arrow">→</span>
              <span class="process-step">法庭辩论</span>
              <span class="process-arrow">→</span>
              <span class="process-step">法庭评议</span>
              <span class="process-arrow">→</span>
              <span class="process-step">宣告判决</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 庭审 -->
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">├</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-secondary">庭审</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 判决 -->
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">└</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <span class="node-box node-secondary">判决</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 举证责任 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 举证责任</div>
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <tr>
          <th>诉讼类型</th>
          <th>举证原则</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>行政诉讼</td>
          <td><strong>举证责任倒置原则</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>民事诉讼</td>
          <td><strong>谁主张谁举证原则</strong></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- 行政诉讼 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 行政诉讼</div>
      <div class="tree-row indent-1">
        <div class="tree-connector">└</div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <div class="node-detail" style="border-left-color: #1a6b3c;">
            对公民、法人和其他组织认为行政机关的行政行为侵犯其合法权益而提起的诉讼
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 行政诉讼的时效期限 -->
    <div class="main-branch">
      <div class="main-branch-header">📌 行政诉讼的时效期限</div>
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <tr>
          <th>诉讼类型</th>
          <th>时效期限</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>行政诉讼</td>
          <td>上诉期限为15日、10日</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>民事诉讼</td>
          <td>上诉期限分别为10日、15日</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
        <span class="red-text">⚠ 限制</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">老师文件代</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
```
